{"version":1,"_note":"信息源页海报专用(tools/banner/dyn_fin.py),组件不用。每家一次 EDGAR Atom 请求(同 latest.df,串行 + 间隔);只取类型 / 日期,正文不进输出。","actions":[{"id":"lst","action":"data.get","params":{"key":"sec_list","default":[]},"_note":"关注列表(首页 / 管理页写入,[{t,n}])。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_b0","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 屏障(勿删):data.get 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dflt","value":"$[if::(gt::(length::(${lst}),0),0,1)]"},"_note":"关注列表为空 → 用默认关注取真实数据,海报标「热门」(2026-10-08 改判,原为退回静态图)。"},{"op":"if","props":{"val":"${dflt}"},"items":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"lst","value":[{"t":"NVDA","n":"NVIDIA"},{"t":"AAPL","n":"Apple"},{"t":"MSFT","n":"Microsoft"},{"t":"TSLA","n":"Tesla"}]}}]},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"cnt","value":"$[length::(${lst})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"t0","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(${lst[0].t},)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"h0","value":"$[if::(gt::(length::(${t0}),0),1,0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"t1","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(${lst[1].t},)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"h1","value":"$[if::(gt::(length::(${t1}),0),1,0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"t2","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(${lst[2].t},)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"h2","value":"$[if::(gt::(length::(${t2}),0),1,0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"t3","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(${lst[3].t},)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"h3","value":"$[if::(gt::(length::(${t3}),0),1,0)]"}},{"op":"if","props":{"val":"${h0}"},"items":[{"action":"request","id":"r0","params":{"url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=${t0}&type=&dateb=&owner=include&count=10&output=atom","method":"GET","formatType":"string","header":{"User-Agent":"Numable support@numable.app","Accept":"application/atom+xml"},"timeout":"12000"}}],"_note":"只取前 4 家;串行(同 latest.df)。owner=include:Form 4 / 144 这类内部人文件也算「最新一份」。"},{"op":"if","props":{"val":"${h1}"},"items":[{"action":"sleep","params":{"timestamp":"150"},"_note":"相邻两次请求之间垫 150ms:SEC 公开限速 10 次/秒,超了按 IP 封 10 分钟。"},{"action":"request","id":"r1","params":{"url":"htt